{"hw":"ἅτε1","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἅτε1</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἅτε</span>, properly acc. pl. neut. of <span class=\"gk\">ὅστε</span> (as in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.779</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.127</span> </span>). <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">just as, as if, so as,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἅ. σήριον ἄστρον</span> prob. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Alcm.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">23.62</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.2</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.30</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.85</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">168</span> </span> (lyr., s. v. l.); <span class=\"gk\">τιμᾶν τινα ἅ. ἱερόφαντιν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Jul.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.221c</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> causal, <b class=\"lex-tr\">inasmuch as, seeing that,</b> with <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἅτε τὸν χρυσὸν ἔχων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.154</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">102</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Cratin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">295</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pax</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">623</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.130</span> </span>, etc.: with gen. abs., <span class=\"gk\">ἅτε τῶν ὁδῶν φυλασσομένων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.123</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Smp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">223b</span> </span>, etc.:—with <span class=\"lex-gram\">part.</span> omitted, <span class=\"gk\">δίκτυα δοὺς [αὐτῷ] ἅτε θηρευτῇ [ὄντι</span>] <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.123</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἅ. γένους προμάτωρ</span> dub. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Th.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">140</span> </span> (lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">ἅ. δή</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.171</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἅ. δὴ οὖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Prt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">321b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὡς ἅ.</span> freq. in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Olymp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in Mete.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">39.12</span> </span>, al.—Rare in Trag., and onlv in lyr.</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἇτε2</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἇτε</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Lacon.</span> </span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = ὡς, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5(1).213</span> </span>.</div></div>"}